Exclusion Criteria:

1. Prior exposure to immune-mediated therapy (with the exclusion of Bacillus Calmette Guerin, BCG), including but not limited to, other anti-CTLA-4, anti-PD-1, anti-PD-L1, or anti-PD-L2 antibodies, including therapeutic anticancer vaccines;
